+## Web and mobile workspace
+
+The repository now also contains the Aura product clients as a pnpm monorepo.
+The existing Python scraper and its MongoDB workflow stay under `src/scraper`.
+
+```bash
+pnpm install
+pnpm dev:web       # Responsive React/Vite app
+pnpm build:web
+```
+
+The web client uses `packages/shared`, which contains the feed types,
+scraper-document adapter, Interest DNA mapper, and vector feedback updates.
+The shared package is ready for the Expo client after the web design is
+finalized. This web app currently runs as a local demo: the repository does not
+yet include an HTTP feed API or account service. See
+[`apps/README.md`](apps/README.md) for the current integration boundaries.
+
